        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    credit_card_number = \"4532015112830365\"\n    total = 0\n    parity = len(credit_card_number) % 2\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    for i, digit in enumerate(credit_card_number):\n        value = int(digit)\n        if i % 2 == parity:\n            value *= 2\n            if value > 9:\n                value -= 9\n        total += value\n\n    answer = total % 10 == 0\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
